Subject: [PATCH 084/127] =?UTF-8?q?ci:=20fix=20auto-approve=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?use=20GITHUB=5FTOKEN=20for=20auto-merge,=20catch=20errors=20gra?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cefully?=
